# AWS Serverless Ecommerce Platform Lab

## Overview
This project demonstrates troubleshooting and configuring a serverless ecommerce platform on AWS.

## Services Used
- AWS Lambda
- API Gateway
- DynamoDB
- Cognito
- Step Functions
- SNS
- CodePipeline
- CodeBuild
- AWS WAF

## Challenges Completed
- Fixed CI/CD pipeline
- Configured Lambda VPC networking
- Integrated API Gateway with Lambda
- Configured Cognito authentication
- Implemented WAF protection
- Fixed cart functionality
- Fixed order processing workflow

## Skills Demonstrated
- Serverless architecture
- Cloud security
- CI/CD
- Event-driven design
- API integration
- AWS troubleshooting

